## Summary
This article introduces '录音笔' (Recording Pen) VOL.771, a member-exclusive podcast series produced by GPASS (机核). Episodes are roughly ten-plus minutes long and consist of short, informal recordings captured from everyday life and conversations in the Gcores office.

## Key Points
- 录音笔 is a member-exclusive program launched by GPASS
- Each episode lasts approximately ten-plus minutes
- Content ranges from casual rambling thoughts and spontaneous outbursts to secretly recorded real office conversations
- Participants and topics vary unpredictably from episode to episode, even to the producers themselves


